### register new trainer → expect 201 (send twice: 2nd → 400 'Invite already used')
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "{{token}}",
  "email": "trainer1@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "firstName": "Ivan",
  "lastName": "Trainer"
}